    "body": "Jumping in here, I was experiencing an issue where Visual Studio Code did not get its $PATH populated when using Fish + Starship.\r\n\r\nChanging the bootstrap config from:\r\n```\r\neval (starship init fish)\r\n```\r\nto\r\n```\r\nstarship init fish | source\r\n```\r\nresolved my issue.\r\n\r\nI'm happy to answer questions about my environment, unfortunately I don't know the precise reason of why this resolves my issue.",
